{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106846","id":2544810813,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Xrrs9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106846","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106846.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106846.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106846","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106846/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106846/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106846/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aa2c3da63aaf4bde75585f8a3108af3ffeefc5e6","number":106846,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement `ModifierBoneTarget3D` which can be target of the other `SkeletonModifier3D`s","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106741\r\n- Alternative of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106838\r\n\r\nAdd a ModifierBoneTarget3D that uses a SkeletonModifier cycle that is nearly equivalent to BoneAttachment's functionality but omits the override pose and external skeleton functionality.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/721d2791-9593-4e8f-a21c-8ba7cd5e3f39)\r\n\r\nThis approach achieves its purpose by placing it between any SkeletonModifier in the SceneTree, without the use of additional signals or enums.\r\n\r\nIt differs from #106838 in that it does not track changes in the modifier after the target has been processed, so its transform and skeleton's final result can be not matched, but its usage is clear and should be simpler than https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106838.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/759fd1b3-e081-4905-8db7-371e3ae2c752)\r\n\r\nAs long as the target is placed before the IK, the target position is updated before the IK.\r\n\r\nFYI property names are matched with BoneAttachment, so we can migrate them by \"Change Type\" option on the SceneDock.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec1230ee-c9bc-48b3-a30a-ce918488f242)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"